00:27:32.784 --> 00:27:33.952
A tea cake.

00:27:33.952 --> 00:27:36.287
This is lemon-flavored.

00:27:36.287 --> 00:27:39.524
And finally, they have a banana loaf cake,

00:27:39.524 --> 00:27:43.194
