00:27:49.801 --> 00:27:51.670
On to the baked goods. In the US,

00:27:51.670 --> 00:27:52.871
you can get an assortment of baked goods,

00:27:52.871 --> 00:27:54.039
as you can see in front of me.

00:27:54.039 --> 00:27:57.175
I'll just start down here. We got scones.

00:27:57.175 --> 00:27:58.910
Oh, this is a blueberry scone.

00:27:58.910 --> 00:28:01.079
Petite vanilla bean scone.

00:28:01.079 --> 00:28:02.747
These can't be the same price.

00:28:02.747 --> 00:28:03.815
Cake pops.

00:28:03.815 --> 00:28:05.150
You got chocolate.

