00:28:08.987 --> 00:28:10.989
Glazed doughnut, ay.

00:28:10.989 --> 00:28:12.123
Red velvet cake.

00:28:12.123 --> 00:28:12.957
Pumpkin loaf.

00:28:12.957 --> 00:28:14.759
You can also get a cinnamon coffee cake.

00:28:14.759 --> 00:28:16.027
Yeah, brownie.

00:28:16.027 --> 00:28:17.395
Chocolate chip cookie.

00:28:17.395 --> 00:28:18.997
Available, yet not today,

00:28:18.997 --> 00:28:21.266
