00:28:21.266 --> 00:28:23.134
It is now time for ice creams.

00:28:23.134 --> 00:28:25.236
Did you know Starbucks makes ice creams?

00:28:25.236 --> 00:28:26.771
I had no idea.

00:28:26.771 --> 00:28:30.375
Java chip ice cream.
This looks really good.

00:28:30.375 --> 00:28:32.377
Check it out, son.

00:28:34.646 --> 00:28:35.613
Yum!

00:28:35.613 --> 00:28:37.716
Coffee, chocolate chips, and mocha.

00:28:37.716 --> 00:28:39.651
That is something else.
I really like this.

00:28:39.651 --> 00:28:41.920
Next up, vanilla ice
cream and chocolate sauce.

00:28:41.920 --> 00:28:44.022
Now, everybody in India,

00:28:44.022 --> 00:28:47.792
their childhood has involved
Amul vanilla ice cream

00:28:47.792 --> 00:28:49.527
and Hershey's chocolate syrup.

00:28:49.527 --> 00:28:53.098
Let's see if this sort
of evokes that nostalgia.

00:28:53.965 --> 00:28:56.701
Ooh, the vanilla ice cream is so good.

00:28:56.701 --> 00:28:59.204
Next up, vanilla ice cream
with strawberry sauce.

00:28:59.204 --> 00:29:01.106
You either got the
Hershey's chocolate sauce

00:29:01.106 --> 00:29:03.441
or the Hershey's strawberry sauce.

00:29:04.576 --> 00:29:07.479
Younger Kini would not
have appreciated this,

00:29:07.479 --> 00:29:09.848
but older Kini, really enjoying it.

00:29:09.848 --> 00:29:13.184
It's fruity, tangy, sour,
and it really complements

00:29:13.184 --> 00:29:15.086
the yummy vanilla creamy ice cream.

00:29:15.086 --> 00:29:17.188
Next up, we have the same java chip,

00:29:17.188 --> 00:29:21.192
but now with more chocolate
chips and chocolate sauce.

00:29:21.192 --> 00:29:23.628
So, this is a bit of an overload.

00:29:24.696 --> 00:29:25.530
Too much.

00:29:25.530 --> 00:29:27.966
Are you, can you zoom in on my hand?

00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:31.169
It's shaking right now.

00:29:31.169 --> 00:29:32.737
Caramel macchiato.

00:29:32.737 --> 00:29:34.172
Mm. It's really nice.

00:29:34.172 --> 00:29:36.708
It's not too sweet. It's kind of salty.

00:29:36.708 --> 00:29:41.079
Next, the affogato, which
is ice cream in coffee.

00:29:42.180 --> 00:29:44.549
I love how we're taking
hot, bitter coffee,

00:29:44.549 --> 00:29:47.185
and sweet, creamy ice
cream, mixing them together,

00:29:47.185 --> 00:29:49.320
and somehow they're not choosing violence.

00:29:49.320 --> 00:29:53.591
They're choosing to be friends,
harmonious in my mouth.

00:29:53.591 --> 00:29:56.494
Affogato again, but
this is house affogato.

00:29:56.494 --> 00:29:58.530
So I'm going to assume, Starbucks,

00:29:58.530 --> 00:29:59.998
