00:29:59.998 --> 00:30:01.699
You're putting your name on it.

00:30:03.401 --> 00:30:04.469
Tastes the same.

00:30:04.469 --> 00:30:07.739
And, finally, we have the
caramel macchiato ice cream.

00:30:07.739 --> 00:30:10.175
It's similar to the small cup
of caramel macchiato I had,

00:30:10.175 --> 00:30:14.112
