00:30:20.118 --> 00:30:21.486
No drizzle of sauces.

00:30:21.486 --> 00:30:23.655
It's not as sweet. It's kind of nice.

00:30:23.655 --> 00:30:27.025
Ladies and gentlemen, we are
finished with this video.

00:30:27.025 --> 00:30:28.259
